hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2741","###\n The Fadl ibn Ya'qub al-Jazari narrated to us, informing us that Ibn Bakr informed us, who informed us that Ibn Jurayj said: I heard Abdullah ibn Ubayd ibn Umayr and Al-Walid ibn Ata' say from Al-Harith ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Rabi'ah. He (Abdullah ibn Ubayd) said: Al-Harith ibn Abdullah visited Abd al-Malik ibn Marwan during his caliphate. Abd al-Malik said"
